# Base used by the API client (axios) and the OAuth "Continue with Google/GitHub"
# buttons, so all three always point at the same place.
#
# Must be a RELATIVE path and must INCLUDE the /api/v1 segment, exactly like the
# default. A bare origin (e.g. https://api.example.com) or a missing /api/v1
# makes both the API calls and the OAuth sign-in links resolve to the wrong spot.
VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
